<title>USA: Donnkenny adds 5 members to board.</title>
<headline>Donnkenny adds 5 members to board.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donnkenny Inc said Tuesday it had elected five new members to its board, increasing the size of the board to nine members.</p>
<p>The new memebers are Herbert Ash, Sheridan Biggs, Robert Cohen, Daniel Levy and Robert Martinsen.</p>
